{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_ai", "label": "AI.md \u2014 \u00ab\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0647\u0646\u062f\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0630\u0643\u064a\u00bb Smart Engineer (v0.29.0)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ai_smart_engineer", "label": "\u00ab\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0647\u0646\u062f\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0630\u0643\u064a\u00bb Smart Engineer (Gemini Flash behind ai-chat)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L1-L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A web-only change on native line 2, shipped as an OTA bundle; the app calls ask() / askJson() with the member JWT, never a key."}, {"id": "docs_ai_gemini_api", "label": "Google Gemini API (streamGenerateContent, SSE)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L8; L15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ai_gemini_api_key", "label": "GEMINI_API_KEY function secret", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L13-L15; L63-L64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The key never reaches the client: the Deploy database workflow sets it from the repo secret and it travels to Google in the x-goog-api-key header, never a URL; rotate it if it was ever pasted anywhere else."}, {"id": "docs_ai_server_side_prompts", "label": "Server-side prompts and JSON schemas (PROMPT_VERSION)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L16-L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Changing a prompt or schema is a function deploy, not an app update; PROMPT_VERSION is bumped with every change."}, {"id": "docs_ai_request_order", "label": "ai-chat request order (auth \u2192 validate \u2192 ai_take \u2192 Gemini \u2192 SSE \u2192 refund / tokens)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L18-L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "auth (db.user(jwt)) \u2192 shape / size validation (per-feature LIMITS) \u2192 key present \u2192 salary aggregates as the member \u2192 ai_take \u2192 Gemini \u2192 SSE \u2192 ai_refund if the model failed before the first word \u2192 ai_tokens."}, {"id": "docs_ai_sse_protocol", "label": "SSE protocol to the app (d / end / err events)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L21-L22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "{t:d,x} deltas and {t:end,remaining}; errors arrive mid-stream as {t:err,code,ar,en} or as JSON with a status; the model's thought parts are never forwarded."}, {"id": "docs_ai_daily_allowance", "label": "Daily AI allowance (25 per Cairo day per member)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L23-L24", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shared across all features."}, {"id": "docs_ai_ai_config", "label": "private.ai_config (enabled, daily_limit, model, model_light)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L23; L26", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ai_ai_take", "label": "ai_take() \u2014 takes one unit (money:false for supervisors)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L19; L43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ai_ai_refund", "label": "ai_refund() \u2014 unit back when the model fails before the first word", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ai_ai_tokens", "label": "ai_tokens() \u2014 token counts only", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ai_ai_quota", "label": "ai_quota() \u2014 remaining units for the quota chip", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L24", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ai_admin_ai_set", "label": "admin_ai_set() \u2014 limit, model and off switch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L24; L67", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Turn AI off instantly with admin_ai_set('enabled', 'false') as an admin, or change daily_limit."}, {"id": "docs_ai_admin_ai_usage", "label": "admin_ai_usage(days) \u2014 staff aggregates only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L24", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never who asked what."}, {"id": "docs_ai_ai_usage_log", "label": "private.ai_usage log (account, day, feature, n, tokens)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No text, ever."}, {"id": "docs_ai_ai_rate", "label": "ai_rate() \u2014 \ud83d\udc4d / \ud83d\udc4e per feature", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ai_model_choice", "label": "Model choice: gemini-3.5-flash-lite + FALLBACK_MODELS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L26-L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Measured on the live key: first word \u2248 0.5 s and a CV review \u2248 8.5 s, while gemini-3.8-flash took \u2248 38 s and hit 429 / 503; on 429 / 5xx before any text the proxy tries gemini-flash-lite-latest then gemini-3.1-flash-lite (each has its own per-minute quota); a 400 is never retried; thinking levels low / medium only."}, {"id": "docs_ai_cv_redaction", "label": "On-phone CV redaction ({{TOKENS}}) + proxy scrub", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L37-L39", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Name, e-mail, phones, LinkedIn, street address and national ID become tokens on the phone before anything is sent; the app restores real values; the proxy scrubs again; the CV text is stored nowhere; consent is asked once."}, {"id": "docs_ai_salary_insights", "label": "AI salary insights (salary_explorer fetched as the member, marketOnly)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L40-L42; L56", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Give-to-get and the 5-report floor apply; only percentiles, n and track / governorate rows of 5+ survive, company rows are dropped; the member's own net salary travels only when they tick \u00ab\u0642\u0627\u0631\u0646 \u0628\u0631\u0627\u062a\u0628\u064a\u00bb; supervisors are refused; 24 h cache per cell."}, {"id": "docs_ai_supervisor_no_money", "label": "Supervisors never get pay talk (server-set noMoney)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L43-L44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ai_take returns money:false for a supervisor and the proxy sets context.noMoney itself \u2014 the app's flag is never trusted."}, {"id": "docs_ai_assistant", "label": "\u00ab\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062f\u00bb assistant tab (streaming Markdown, role starters)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L46-L47; L53", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sends the profile's discipline / track / level and the role's tool list, never the name; history stays on the phone (last 60 messages; the last 12 turns / ~18k characters travel); 7-day cache for a repeated first question."}, {"id": "docs_ai_cv_review", "label": "AI CV review (cv-review JSON schema over the on-device engine)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L54", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The on-device engine stays the instant result and the offline fallback; the AI result is laid over the same cards with a number guard on the rebuilt CV."}, {"id": "docs_ai_smart_forms", "label": "Smart forms (RFI, material submittal, custody handover, toolbox talk, permit)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L55", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Missing facts come back as [\u0623\u0636\u0641: \u2026]; the permit stays a draft \u2014 the AI never authorises; every tool document also exports to PDF and Word."}, {"id": "docs_ai_tool_tips", "label": "\ud83d\udca1 Tool tips (concrete, BBS, site diary, level book; light model)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L45; L57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Asked only on a tap; sends the tool's own one-screen summary, never names; can be dismissed per tool; 7-day cache."}, {"id": "docs_ai_graceful_degradation", "label": "Graceful AI degradation (not_ready, offline, demo)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L14; L59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An absent key answers \u00ab\u063a\u064a\u0631 \u0645\u0641\u0639\u0651\u0644 \u0641\u064a \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0633\u062e\u0629 \u0628\u0639\u062f\u00bb (not_ready) and takes no unit; offline or in the demo each surface says so in one line and the tool keeps working by hand."}, {"id": "docs_ai_proposed_next_steps", "label": "Proposed AI next steps (admin usage panel, prompt A/B, proactive tips, photo \u2192 NCR)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L69-L74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_ai", "target": "docs_ai_smart_engineer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L1-L11", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ai", "target": "docs_ai_gemini_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L8; L15", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ai", "target": "docs_ai_gemini_api_key", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L13-L15; L63-L64", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ai", "target": "docs_ai_server_side_prompts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L16-L17", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ai", "target": "docs_ai_request_order", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L18-L20", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ai", "target": "docs_ai_sse_protocol", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/AI.md", "source_location": "L21-L22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ai", "target": "docs_ai_daily_allowance", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0,